{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"text-tools","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Text Tools","description":"Sort, clean, convert case, encode and generate text: 45 commands for selections or whole files.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Tools"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","main":"extension.js","activationEvents":["onCommand:textTools.sortAsc","onCommand:textTools.sortDesc","onCommand:textTools.sortCaseInsensitive","onCommand:textTools.sortNumeric","onCommand:textTools.sortByLength","onCommand:textTools.unique","onCommand:textTools.reverse","onCommand:textTools.shuffle","onCommand:textTools.join","onCommand:textTools.trim","onCommand:textTools.trimBoth","onCommand:textTools.removeBlank","onCommand:textTools.collapseBlank","onCommand:textTools.numberLines","onCommand:textTools.quoteLines","onCommand:textTools.bullets","onCommand:textTools.tabsToSpaces","onCommand:textTools.spacesToTabs","onCommand:textTools.wrap","onCommand:textTools.changeCase","onCommand:textTools.upper","onCommand:textTools.lower","onCommand:textTools.title","onCommand:textTools.sentence","onCommand:textTools.camel","onCommand:textTools.pascal","onCommand:textTools.snake","onCommand:textTools.kebab","onCommand:textTools.constant","onCommand:textTools.swapCase","onCommand:textTools.base64Encode","onCommand:textTools.base64Decode","onCommand:textTools.urlEncode","onCommand:textTools.urlDecode","onCommand:textTools.htmlEncode","onCommand:textTools.htmlDecode","onCommand:textTools.jsonEscape","onCommand:textTools.jsonUnescape","onCommand:textTools.hexEncode","onCommand:textTools.hexDecode","onCommand:textTools.rot13","onCommand:textTools.slugify","onCommand:textTools.insertUuid","onCommand:textTools.insertUuidMany","onCommand:textTools.insertDate","onCommand:textTools.insertLorem","onCommand:textTools.insertSeparator","onCommand:textTools.randomString"],"permissions":[],"contributes":{"commands":[{"command":"textTools.sortAsc","title":"Sort Lines Ascending","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.sortDesc","title":"Sort Lines Descending","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.sortCaseInsensitive","title":"Sort Lines (Ignore Case)","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.sortNumeric","title":"Sort Lines by Number","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.sortByLength","title":"Sort Lines by Length","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.unique","title":"Remove Duplicate Lines","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.reverse","title":"Reverse Lines","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.shuffle","title":"Shuffle Lines","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.join","title":"Join Lines","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.trim","title":"Trim Trailing Whitespace","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.trimBoth","title":"Trim Whitespace on Both Sides","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.removeBlank","title":"Remove Blank Lines","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.collapseBlank","title":"Collapse Repeated Blank Lines","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.numberLines","title":"Number Lines","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.quoteLines","title":"Quote Lines as JSON Strings","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.bullets","title":"Turn Lines into a Bullet List","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.tabsToSpaces","title":"Convert Tabs to Spaces","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.spacesToTabs","title":"Convert Spaces to Tabs","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.wrap","title":"Wrap Long Lines","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.changeCase","title":"Change Case...","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.upper","title":"To UPPER CASE","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.lower","title":"To lower case","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.title","title":"To Title Case","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.sentence","title":"To Sentence case","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.camel","title":"To camelCase","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.pascal","title":"To PascalCase","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.snake","title":"To snake_case","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.kebab","title":"To kebab-case","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.constant","title":"To CONSTANT_CASE","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.swapCase","title":"Swap Case","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.base64Encode","title":"Base64 Encode","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.base64Decode","title":"Base64 Decode","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.urlEncode","title":"URL Encode","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.urlDecode","title":"URL Decode","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.htmlEncode","title":"HTML Entities Encode","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.htmlDecode","title":"HTML Entities Decode","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.jsonEscape","title":"Escape for a JSON String","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.jsonUnescape","title":"Unescape a JSON String","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.hexEncode","title":"Text to Hex","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.hexDecode","title":"Hex to Text","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.rot13","title":"ROT13","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.slugify","title":"Slugify","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.insertUuid","title":"Insert UUID","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.insertUuidMany","title":"Insert Several UUIDs","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.insertDate","title":"Insert Date and Time...","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.insertLorem","title":"Insert Lorem Ipsum","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.insertSeparator","title":"Insert a Separator Line","category":"Text Tools"},{"command":"textTools.randomString","title":"Insert a Random String","category":"Text Tools"}],"keybindings":[{"command":"textTools.sortAsc","key":"Shift+Alt+S"},{"command":"textTools.changeCase","key":"Shift+Alt+C"},{"command":"textTools.insertUuid","key":"Shift+Alt+U"}],"configuration":{"title":"Text Tools","properties":{"textTools.tabSize":{"type":"number","default":4,"description":"How many spaces a tab is when converting."},"textTools.wrapColumn":{"type":"number","default":80,"description":"The column that Wrap Long Lines wraps at."},"textTools.loremParagraphs":{"type":"number","default":3,"description":"The default number of Lorem Ipsum paragraphs."}}}}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"extension.js":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"// Text Tools: sort, clean, convert case, encode and generate text. Works on the selection, or on the whole file when nothing is selected.\n\nconst split = (t) => t.split('\\n');\n\nfunction words(s) {\n  return s\n    .replace(/([a-z0-9])([A-Z])/g, '$1 $2')\n    .replace(/([A-Z]+)([A-Z][a-z])/g, '$1 $2')\n    .split(/[^A-Za-z0-9]+/)\n    .filter(Boolean);\n}\nconst cap = (w) => w.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + w.slice(1).toLowerCase();\n\nconst caseOps = {\n  upper: (s) => s.toUpperCase(),\n  lower: (s) => s.toLowerCase(),\n  title: (s) => s.replace(/\\w\\S*/g, (w) => cap(w)),\n  sentence: (s) => s.toLowerCase().replace(/(^\\s*|[.!?]\\s+)([a-z])/g, (m, a, b) => a + b.toUpperCase()),\n  camel: (s) => words(s).map((w, i) => (i ? cap(w) : w.toLowerCase())).join(''),\n  pascal: (s) => words(s).map(cap).join(''),\n  snake: (s) => words(s).map((w) => w.toLowerCase()).join('_'),\n  kebab: (s) => words(s).map((w) => w.toLowerCase()).join('-'),\n  constant: (s) => words(s).map((w) => w.toUpperCase()).join('_'),\n  dot: (s) => words(s).map((w) => w.toLowerCase()).join('.'),\n  path: (s) => words(s).map((w) => w.toLowerCase()).join('/'),\n  swap: (s) => s.replace(/[A-Za-z]/g, (c) => (c === c.toUpperCase() ? c.toLowerCase() : c.toUpperCase())),\n};\n\nconst lineOps = {\n  sortAsc: (t) => split(t).sort((a, b) => a.localeCompare(b)).join('\\n'),\n  sortDesc: (t) => split(t).sort((a, b) => b.localeCompare(a)).join('\\n'),\n  sortCI: (t) => split(t).sort((a, b) => a.toLowerCase().localeCompare(b.toLowerCase())).join('\\n'),\n  sortNum: (t) => split(t).sort((a, b) => (parseFloat(a.replace(/[^0-9.\\-]/g, '')) || 0) - (parseFloat(b.replace(/[^0-9.\\-]/g, '')) || 0)).join('\\n'),\n  sortLen: (t) => split(t).sort((a, b) => a.length - b.length).join('\\n'),\n  unique: (t) => [...new Set(split(t))].join('\\n'),\n  reverse: (t) => split(t).reverse().join('\\n'),\n  shuffle: (t) => {\n    const a = split(t);\n    for (let i = a.length - 1; i > 0; i--) {\n      const j = Math.floor(Math.random() * (i + 1));\n      [a[i], a[j]] = [a[j], a[i]];\n    }\n    return a.join('\\n');\n  },\n  join: (t) => split(t).map((l) => l.trim()).filter(Boolean).join(' '),\n  trim: (t) => split(t).map((l) => l.replace(/[ \\t]+$/g, '')).join('\\n'),\n  trimBoth: (t) => split(t).map((l) => l.trim()).join('\\n'),\n  blank: (t) => split(t).filter((l) => l.trim() !== '').join('\\n'),\n  collapseBlank: (t) => t.replace(/\\n{3,}/g, '\\n\\n'),\n  number: (t) => {\n    const a = split(t);\n    const w = String(a.length).length;\n    return a.map((l, i) => String(i + 1).padStart(w, '0') + '  ' + l).join('\\n');\n  },\n  indent: (t, n = 2) => split(t).map((l) => (l ? ' '.repeat(n) + l : l)).join('\\n'),\n  outdent: (t, n = 2) => split(t).map((l) => l.replace(new RegExp('^ {1,' + n + '}'), '')).join('\\n'),\n  tabsToSpaces: (t, n = 4) => t.replace(/\\t/g, ' '.repeat(n)),\n  spacesToTabs: (t, n = 4) => split(t).map((l) => l.replace(new RegExp('^((?: {' + n + '})+)'), (m) => '\\t'.repeat(m.length / n))).join('\\n'),\n  wrap: (t, width = 80) =>\n    split(t)\n      .map((line) => {\n        if (line.length <= width) return line;\n        const out = [];\n        let cur = '';\n        for (const w of line.split(/\\s+/)) {\n          if (cur && (cur + ' ' + w).length > width) {\n            out.push(cur);\n            cur = w;\n          } else cur = cur ? cur + ' ' + w : w;\n        }\n        out.push(cur);\n        return out.join('\\n');\n      })\n      .join('\\n'),\n  quote: (t) => split(t).map((l) => JSON.stringify(l)).join(',\\n'),\n  bullet: (t) => split(t).map((l) => (l.trim() ? '- ' + l.replace(/^\\s*[-*]\\s*/, '') : l)).join('\\n'),\n};\n\nconst b64e = (s) => {\n  let x = '';\n  for (const c of new TextEncoder().encode(s)) x += String.fromCharCode(c);\n  return btoa(x);\n};\nconst b64d = (s) => new TextDecoder().decode(Uint8Array.from(atob(s.trim()), (c) => c.charCodeAt(0)));\nconst htmlE = (s) => s.replace(/&/g, '&amp;').replace(/</g, '&lt;').replace(/>/g, '&gt;').replace(/\"/g, '&quot;').replace(/'/g, '&#39;');\nconst htmlD = (s) =>\n  s\n    .replace(/&#x([0-9a-f]+);/gi, (m, h) => String.fromCodePoint(parseInt(h, 16)))\n    .replace(/&#(\\d+);/g, (m, d) => String.fromCodePoint(parseInt(d, 10)))\n    .replace(/&lt;/g, '<')\n    .replace(/&gt;/g, '>')\n    .replace(/&quot;/g, '\"')\n    .replace(/&apos;/g, \"'\")\n    .replace(/&amp;/g, '&');\n\nconst codecOps = {\n  b64e,\n  b64d,\n  urlE: (s) => encodeURIComponent(s),\n  urlD: (s) => decodeURIComponent(s),\n  htmlE,\n  htmlD,\n  jsonE: (s) => JSON.stringify(s).slice(1, -1),\n  jsonD: (s) => JSON.parse('\"' + s + '\"'),\n  hexE: (s) => Array.from(new TextEncoder().encode(s), (b) => b.toString(16).padStart(2, '0')).join(' '),\n  hexD: (s) => new TextDecoder().decode(Uint8Array.from(s.trim().split(/[\\s,]+/).map((h) => parseInt(h, 16)))),\n  rot13: (s) => s.replace(/[A-Za-z]/g, (c) => String.fromCharCode(((c.charCodeAt(0) - (c <= 'Z' ? 65 : 97) + 13) % 26) + (c <= 'Z' ? 65 : 97))),\n  slug: (s) => s.normalize('NFD').replace(/[̀-ͯ]/g, '').toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9]+/g, '-').replace(/^-+|-+$/g, ''),\n};\n\nconst LOREM = 'lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipiscing elit sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua enim ad minim veniam quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi aliquip ex ea commodo consequat duis aute irure in reprehenderit voluptate velit esse cillum fugiat nulla pariatur excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat non proident sunt culpa qui officia deserunt mollit anim id est laborum'.split(' ');\nfunction lorem(paragraphs) {\n  const out = [];\n  for (let p = 0; p < paragraphs; p++) {\n    const sentences = [];\n    for (let s = 0; s < 4 + (p % 3); s++) {\n      const n = 8 + ((p * 7 + s * 5) % 9);\n      const ws = [];\n      for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) ws.push(LOREM[(p * 31 + s * 17 + i * 7) % LOREM.length]);\n      const text = ws.join(' ');\n      sentences.push(text.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + text.slice(1) + '.');\n    }\n    out.push(sentences.join(' '));\n  }\n  return out.join('\\n\\n');\n}\n\nfunction uuid() {\n  if (typeof crypto !== 'undefined' && crypto.randomUUID) return crypto.randomUUID();\n  return 'xxxxxxxx-xxxx-4xxx-yxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx'.replace(/[xy]/g, (c) => {\n    const r = (Math.random() * 16) | 0;\n    return (c === 'x' ? r : (r & 3) | 8).toString(16);\n  });\n}\n\nfunction pad(n) {\n  return String(n).padStart(2, '0');\n}\nfunction stamp(kind, d = new Date()) {\n  switch (kind) {\n    case 'iso': return d.toISOString();\n    case 'date': return d.getFullYear() + '-' + pad(d.getMonth() + 1) + '-' + pad(d.getDate());\n    case 'time': return pad(d.getHours()) + ':' + pad(d.getMinutes()) + ':' + pad(d.getSeconds());\n    case 'datetime': return stamp('date', d) + ' ' + stamp('time', d);\n    case 'epoch': return String(Math.floor(d.getTime() / 1000));\n    case 'epochms': return String(d.getTime());\n    case 'utc': return d.toUTCString();\n    default: return d.toString();\n  }\n}\n\nexports._test = { caseOps, lineOps, codecOps, lorem, uuid, stamp, words };\n\nexports.activate = function (context) {\n  const reg = (id, fn) => context.subscriptions.push(ferrum.commands.register(id, fn));\n\n  /** Applies fn to the selection, or to the whole file when nothing is selected. One undoable edit. */\n  async function transform(fn, label) {\n    const doc = await ferrum.editor.active();\n    if (!doc) return ferrum.window.showMessage('Open a file first.', 'warn');\n    try {\n      if (doc.selectedText) {\n        await ferrum.editor.insert(fn(doc.selectedText));\n      } else {\n        const lines = doc.text.split('\\n');\n        const end = { line: lines.length - 1, col: lines[lines.length - 1].length };\n        const next = fn(doc.text);\n        if (next !== doc.text) await ferrum.editor.replace({ start: { line: 0, col: 0 }, end }, next);\n      }\n    } catch (e) {\n      ferrum.window.showMessage((label || 'This') + ' failed: ' + (e && e.message ? e.message : e), 'error');\n    }\n  }\n  const ins = async (text) => {\n    const doc = await ferrum.editor.active();\n    if (!doc) return ferrum.window.showMessage('Open a file first.', 'warn');\n    await ferrum.editor.insert(text);\n  };\n\n  const map = {\n    'textTools.sortAsc': lineOps.sortAsc, 'textTools.sortDesc': lineOps.sortDesc, 'textTools.sortCaseInsensitive': lineOps.sortCI, 'textTools.sortNumeric': lineOps.sortNum, 'textTools.sortByLength': lineOps.sortLen,\n    'textTools.unique': lineOps.unique, 'textTools.reverse': lineOps.reverse, 'textTools.shuffle': lineOps.shuffle, 'textTools.join': lineOps.join,\n    'textTools.trim': lineOps.trim, 'textTools.trimBoth': lineOps.trimBoth, 'textTools.removeBlank': lineOps.blank, 'textTools.collapseBlank': lineOps.collapseBlank,\n    'textTools.numberLines': lineOps.number, 'textTools.quoteLines': lineOps.quote, 'textTools.bullets': lineOps.bullet,\n    'textTools.tabsToSpaces': (t) => lineOps.tabsToSpaces(t, Number(ferrum.settings.get('textTools.tabSize')) || 4),\n    'textTools.spacesToTabs': (t) => lineOps.spacesToTabs(t, Number(ferrum.settings.get('textTools.tabSize')) || 4),\n    'textTools.wrap': (t) => lineOps.wrap(t, Number(ferrum.settings.get('textTools.wrapColumn')) || 80),\n    'textTools.upper': caseOps.upper, 'textTools.lower': caseOps.lower, 'textTools.title': caseOps.title, 'textTools.sentence': caseOps.sentence,\n    'textTools.camel': caseOps.camel, 'textTools.pascal': caseOps.pascal, 'textTools.snake': caseOps.snake, 'textTools.kebab': caseOps.kebab, 'textTools.constant': caseOps.constant,\n    'textTools.swapCase': caseOps.swap, 'textTools.base64Encode': codecOps.b64e, 'textTools.base64Decode': codecOps.b64d,\n    'textTools.urlEncode': codecOps.urlE, 'textTools.urlDecode': codecOps.urlD, 'textTools.htmlEncode': codecOps.htmlE, 'textTools.htmlDecode': codecOps.htmlD,\n    'textTools.jsonEscape': codecOps.jsonE, 'textTools.jsonUnescape': codecOps.jsonD, 'textTools.hexEncode': codecOps.hexE, 'textTools.hexDecode': codecOps.hexD,\n    'textTools.rot13': codecOps.rot13, 'textTools.slugify': codecOps.slug,\n  };\n  for (const [id, fn] of Object.entries(map)) reg(id, () => transform(fn, id));\n\n  reg('textTools.changeCase', async () => {\n    const pick = await ferrum.window.showQuickPick(\n      [['UPPER CASE', 'upper'], ['lower case', 'lower'], ['Title Case', 'title'], ['Sentence case', 'sentence'], ['camelCase', 'camel'], ['PascalCase', 'pascal'], ['snake_case', 'snake'], ['kebab-case', 'kebab'], ['CONSTANT_CASE', 'constant'], ['dot.case', 'dot'], ['path/case', 'path'], ['sWAP cASE', 'swap']].map(([label, key]) => ({ label, detail: key })),\n      { placeholder: 'Change case to...' },\n    );\n    if (pick) await transform(caseOps[pick.detail], 'Change case');\n  });\n\n  reg('textTools.insertUuid', () => ins(uuid()));\n  reg('textTools.insertUuidMany', async () => {\n    const n = Number(await ferrum.window.showInputBox({ prompt: 'How many UUIDs?', value: '5' }));\n    if (n > 0 && n <= 1000) await ins(Array.from({ length: n }, uuid).join('\\n'));\n  });\n  reg('textTools.insertDate', async () => {\n    const kinds = ['date', 'datetime', 'time', 'iso', 'epoch', 'epochms', 'utc'];\n    const pick = await ferrum.window.showQuickPick(kinds.map((k) => ({ label: stamp(k), detail: k })), { placeholder: 'Insert the current date and time as...' });\n    if (pick) await ins(pick.label);\n  });\n  reg('textTools.insertLorem', async () => {\n    const n = Number(await ferrum.window.showInputBox({ prompt: 'How many paragraphs?', value: String(ferrum.settings.get('textTools.loremParagraphs') || 3) }));\n    if (n > 0 && n <= 50) await ins(lorem(n));\n  });\n  reg('textTools.insertSeparator', () => ins('-'.repeat(Number(ferrum.settings.get('textTools.wrapColumn')) || 80)));\n  reg('textTools.randomString', async () => {\n    const n = Number(await ferrum.window.showInputBox({ prompt: 'Length of the random string?', value: '24' }));\n    if (!(n > 0 && n <= 4096)) return;\n    const chars = 'ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz0123456789';\n    const bytes = new Uint8Array(n);\n    (typeof crypto !== 'undefined' && crypto.getRandomValues ? crypto.getRandomValues(bytes) : bytes.forEach((_, i) => (bytes[i] = Math.floor(Math.random() * 256))));\n    await ins(Array.from(bytes, (b) => chars[b % chars.length]).join(''));\n  });\n};\n\nexports.deactivate = function () {};\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Text Tools\n\nThe everyday text jobs, one command each. Every command works on your **selection**, or on the **whole file** when nothing is selected, as one undoable edit.\n\n## Lines\nSort (ascending, descending, ignoring case, by number, by length), remove duplicates, reverse, shuffle, join, trim, remove blank lines, number lines, quote lines as JSON strings, make a bullet list, wrap long lines, convert tabs and spaces.\n\n## Case\nUPPER, lower, Title, Sentence, camelCase, PascalCase, snake_case, kebab-case, CONSTANT_CASE and swap case. \"Change Case...\" shows them all in a list.\n\n## Encode and decode\nBase64, URL, HTML entities, JSON string escapes, hex, ROT13 and slugify.\n\n## Insert\nUUID v4 (one or many), the date and time in seven formats, Lorem Ipsum, a separator line and a random string.\n\n## Shortcuts\nShift+Alt+S sorts lines, Shift+Alt+C changes case, Shift+Alt+U inserts a UUID. Change them in **Settings > Keyboard shortcuts**.\n\n## Permissions\nNone. It only edits the file you are working on.\n"}}}